Counterfactual k (program 2026-11-15 quiet holds, slice 2, section 8 bullet 3)

A remembered yes no longer needs the installed copy to be approved: `_put_back_same` drops its `_approved(place)` test.

Run in a `git archive` export of the commit above (no .git), so the worktree was never modified. The change was an exact string swap in canary/watcher.py that matched once; the original bytes were written back after the run.

## The change

